# Keep the Docker build context small and fast — see src/Web/Store.Web/Dockerfile's comment for
# why the context is the whole repo root in the first place (Central Package Management).

# Build output (restored fresh inside the image)
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Never needed inside an image: no test project is referenced by Store.Web/Store.Worker, so
# `dotnet restore <single csproj>` never touches tests/ — safe to exclude from context entirely.
tests/

# Raw ThemeForest template source (175MB+) — only the curated subset already committed under
# src/Web/Store.Web/wwwroot/ecomus is actually served at runtime (see docs/decisions.md, Phase 5).
ecomus-package/
Mecodex-Brand-Assets/

# Not needed at build/runtime
docs/
.git/
.claude/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
logs/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
